        "Text": {
          "text": "Today is 2026-06-10. In our helpdesk, escalate every OPEN ticket that was created MORE than 7 days ago AND whose body mentions a refund: set its priority to \"high\" and add the tag \"billing-escalation\". Subjects do not mention refunds — you must check ticket bodies. Do not modify any other ticket. When done, submit {\"escalated_ticket_ids\": [..]} via submit_result.",
